verses.1:
A Maskil + 78:1 Maskil is probably a musical or liturgical term; used for Psalms 32, 42, 44–45, 52–55, 74, 78, 88–89, and 142. of Asaph.
 Give ear, O my people, to my instruction;
 listen to the words of my mouth.

verses.50:
He cleared a path for His anger;
 He did not spare them from death
 but delivered their lives to the plague.

verses.55:
He drove out nations before them
 and apportioned their inheritance;
 He settled the tribes of Israel in their tents.
